 (284059,"honor (kabod)",284068,"v11: 'favour and HONOUR (kabod)' - God's honour bestowed. Qualifier."),
 (284061,"good (tob)",284068,"v11: 'No GOOD (tob) thing does he withhold' - God's goodness. Qualifier."),
