 (284086,"finds (matsa)","v3: 'the sparrow FINDS (matsa) a home' - the bird's finding a place, image. Standalone."),
 (284088,"swallow (deror)","v3: 'and the SWALLOW (deror) a nest for herself' - the nesting bird, image. Standalone."),
