 (284093,"altars (mizbeach)","v3: 'at your ALTARS (mizbeach), O LORD of hosts' - the temple altars, the longed-for home. Standalone."),
 (284110,"highways (mesillah)","v5: 'in whose heart are the HIGHWAYS (mesillah) to Zion' - the pilgrim roads, image of the inward journey. Standalone."),
