 (284115,"springs (mayan)","v6: 'a place of SPRINGS (mayan)' - the water in the desert, image of refreshment. Standalone."),
 (284116,"early rain (moreh)","v6: 'the EARLY RAIN (moreh) also covers it with pools' - the autumn rain, image of blessing on the way. Standalone."),
